{"id":10000100,"name":"卡齐娜","enName":"Kachina","title":"斑金矿朴","element":"岩","region":"纳塔","rarity":4,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"4月22日","constellation":"鼠兔座","description":"纳茨卡延的年轻战士，受赐古名「乌沙博蒂」。善良执着的少女，在挫折中不断成长。","affiliation":"纳茨卡延","cv":{"chinese":"静宸","japanese":"久保百合花","english":"克里斯汀·麦奎尔","korean":"孙仙荣"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000100-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000100-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Kachina.zip","voicePackageEn":"Kachina","quoteCount":70,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"你好呀，我是「回声之子」的卡齐娜。喜欢吃颗粒果，想要变强，不擅长打架。啊…不是说这些的时候？那、那…请问你接下来想去哪里走走？我挺熟悉这一带的，就让我来带路吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/4mite8a3dwh0j35w8rwe00fgvfsttbs.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·整理癖","desc":"啊…我刚刚发现有块砖没有堆整齐。怎么办？现在感觉心里有只小龙在不停地挠啊挠。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/rg9sybqe21roghakl5mn2zkcjw1axqp.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·行不行","desc":"我可以、我不行、我可以、我…唔唔，没事的，我可以的，一定没问题的…对吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/ehpumrc7vvz1yytfpwxrccnldbowlkj.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·收藏品","desc":"无聊的话，要不要一起来看看我包里的收藏？看上什么拿走也没关系哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/dps8g33yphpeza39vsbsysi57r3qvni.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"雨水会让泥土变得松软，所以雨天挖矿一定要比平时更加更加小心哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/7ng2abwlu7foav20vewqzzxm82kfknk.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"呀——啊…我、我不是害怕，只是被吓了一跳而已。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/70/mzuadvzv2vktyqtduton2etfeahcs47.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"我们一起去雪地上打滚吧，嘿嘿。你放心，我不会像阿尤一样，钻到雪里又突然冒出来吓你的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/3uj2fsc5vsfszm6ahfo2gdech2jymaw.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"快看这块宝石！在太阳的照射下，它里面好像藏着彩虹。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/75hibwxqwf12okjjwgslgp0jkq50sk9.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"这下面会不会藏着金闪闪的矿石？要不要挖挖看？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/6j0xvd8mi8fwn2001x3lw4whu4oxj8e.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早呀，我已经整理好背包啦，我们随时可以出发。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/eob0sydmamadktvoeixp6jen5pnrmn8.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"我不困，但如果你想午睡一会儿的话，我可以帮你望风。虽然我有许多不擅长的事情，但…我的耳朵还算灵敏。远处的风吹草动，我都能感觉到。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c8/h1wzj3cuy7ir36j7saogfhx3vwcj2t3.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"玛拉妮邀请我晚上去山洞试胆，我我我，好紧张，怎么办？我不想拒绝朋友，就…就闭上眼睛答应了…不、不管发生什么事情，我都应该和她一起面对。欸？你也一起来吗？太、太好了！呜…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/40/3k34gcwq47acr99tps4c2zgevc7xxlc.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"今天怎么又把事情给搞砸了，呜呜呜…怎么办，明明不想哭的，但眼泪完全停不下来了，呜呜…噫——，刚、刚刚我们不是互相说了晚安，要去睡觉了吗？但谢谢你安慰我…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/407bsqxskbrh7gzryrw3025haucajml.mp3"},{"title":"关于卡齐娜自己·冲天转转","desc":"这个名字是我和阿尤一起取的。我先想好了前半部分，又根据阿尤的动作定下了后半。我常常会乘着它和阿尤比赛跑步，我们各有输赢呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/a45517h5z94o0hcjrs00mud8hc0c044.mp3"},{"title":"关于卡齐娜自己·死亡","desc":"能在「巡夜者战争」中死去，对纳塔战士们来说是一种荣光，身为其中一员的我也不该例外…但当时我一边这样告诉自己，一边在心里害怕得要命…你们冒着巨大的危险从夜神之国把我带回来，我真的非常感激！呜呜，谢谢你们每个人…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/g9psg8u5dzt9gcpzlyy11d2miv6mct1.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·传说","desc":"纳塔流传着很多英雄传说，其中我最喜欢的就是陶奥鲁大人的事迹，居然能以血肉之躯把深渊给封入地下，实在太厉害了！对了对了，你走过了那么多国家，一定也知道很多传说故事吧？我真的很好奇…有空的时候可以和我讲讲吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/0dcyf0djukk62uysedmd19p10gt0z3j.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·小礼物","desc":"来挑一个你喜欢的吧！作为我们是好朋友的证明。我能收集到的最好看、最闪亮的矿石全都在这里啦。如果你愿意选一颗收下的话，我会很开心的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/hh1vq478am7wrj33z37fldyjxn8ejco.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"在我第一次看到这枚亮晶晶神之眼的时候，我还以为自己眼花了呢，它比我见过的任何一块石头都要闪亮。虽然我现在与那些传说中的英雄相比，还差得很远，但如果有一天，我的故事也能激励别人，哪怕只有一个人也好，那也会成为我最大的幸福…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/hd0iudr2to4jtk4otq4spymea2uaiml.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"阿尤是我很重要的伙伴，别看它现在模样乖巧，它再小些的时候，表达喜欢的方式是冲过来用头撞人。它力气可大了，有时候我都会被它撞得摔倒。不过这也没办法嘛，毕竟嵴锋龙是一种很亲人的龙。哎呀，别撞我呀，阿尤，好好好，我不揭你短啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/cfhy8sekspomnpyc5j3d5alda3ekqwy.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"澄晶实的果实形状就像宝石一样，如果它也能像宝石一样长时间存放就好了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a2/7kvr2om8iq3inemjgshxb5r2e8yvdsm.mp3"},{"title":"关于玛拉妮…","desc":"玛拉妮是我的第一个好朋友。遇到她之前，我都不知道这个世界上有这么好的人，还有这么多好玩的事情。看，这是我们合影的画片。她说是要在合影时一起往上跳…你说我动作看着有点僵硬？嘿嘿…被你发现了…当时镜头外有很多人在看着我们，让我有点紧张…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_mualani_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/35/gktd69vaxxur8jgwv5usg671tegbixm.mp3"},{"title":"关于基尼奇…","desc":"基尼奇哥哥还是玛拉妮介绍给我认识的呢。不瞒你说，一开始我有点害怕他，因为他的眼神看起来…稍微有一点凶。我后来才知道，他私底下教训过欺负我的坏蛋。但在我送他回礼的时候，他又不肯收下，说是已经得到了足额的报酬…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_kinich_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/9ekvy4fc72ibif3aqbpo1p4px2cu1xv.mp3"},{"title":"关于恰斯卡…","desc":"她是纳塔有名的「调停人」，据说任何争斗都能被她轻松摆平。她会这么做，恐怕是像我一样，很讨厌人与人之间起什么冲突吧…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_chasca_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/shzd87i8ep2ejwn0p6ydbdv8p1bep15.mp3"},{"title":"关于伊安珊…","desc":"之前为了变强，我拜托伊安珊带我训练。她安排了各种各样高强度的锻炼方式，我常常需要咬紧牙关才能坚持下去。好在她给我安排的训练量非常精准，每次结束后都留出了供我走回家的体力…我还是很感谢她的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_iansan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/28x0w51dusdhrr56ygret0q6o06jcuj.mp3"},{"title":"关于茜特菈莉…","desc":"玛拉妮和我说了，你们能救出我，还多亏了她的发明。「灵觉髓石」坏掉了，我也有不可推脱的责任…后来我鼓起勇气去找她道歉了，并且让她在我收藏的石头里挑几块，她挠着头说：「这，我不挑一个是不是很麻烦啊。拿个差不多的我们就两清，是吧？」最后只拿走了最不起眼的一块黑曜石，就摆了摆手让我走了。你说，我要不要再帮她找点什么？她喜欢什么，你知道吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_citlali_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/m9pqof2xu893i0agjoy4e5plfpua30o.mp3"},{"title":"关于希诺宁…","desc":"在我获得古名后，帕加尔叔叔带我去找了希诺宁姐姐，请她帮我打造了冲天转转，她的手艺简直出神入化。\n后来，我们交流过宝石收藏与存储的经验，还欣赏了彼此的珍品。她的收藏品状态非常好，肯定照顾得十分细致。但她自己的生活…似乎要更加随性？有一次我找了她很久都没找到，最后发现她在一棵大树上晒着太阳睡着了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_xilonen_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/2phmbtm9tfjgj5ippv9qoq9sgu3xemk.mp3"},{"title":"关于火神大人…","desc":"我做梦都想不到，居然有一天能被火神大人亲口认可为「纳塔的英雄」，火神大人是每一位纳塔战士的偶像，我…我得到了偶像的…呜…我一想起来就太感动了，呜呜呜…对不起，对不起对不起。不该在这时候哭的…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_mavuika_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/ixrjng4654hkn241chd3ztzvl28zfwu.mp3"},{"title":"关于伊法…","desc":"伊法哥哥是个很厉害的龙医生！凡是给他看过病的小龙，回来后都作息规律、不乱吃乱跑，几乎再没生过病啦。所以每当大家发现有龙身体不舒服，第一反应都是请他飞过来看一看。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_teammate_ifa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/ftnr33knpgc82cc12oc6y0mac2fbb0o.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解卡齐娜·其一","desc":"「乌沙博蒂」是我的古名，它的意思是坚强，唉，可很多时候我都想不明白为什么这个古名会给我。我那么弱小，不管是在家里，还是在部族里，存在感都不算高…有那么多优秀的人在身边，我真的有拥有它的资格吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/ggqtpvsrin4vfamp3jd0moev6cm0a56.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解卡齐娜·其二","desc":"要说我家人的话…我在家中排行第二。我知道爸爸把期许主要寄托在了姐姐身上，而妈妈现在又要照顾年幼的妹妹。我们的生活有些辛苦，所以我需要管好自己，早点长大…至少让爸爸妈妈少操点心。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/dj1hqg4x8aaz86u7be53j8z47qb1tky.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解卡齐娜·其三","desc":"帕加尔叔叔待我很好。部族里其他人议论我的时候，他总会帮我说话。其实…他那样做，我心里反而过意不去。我只有靠自己的实力赢得大家认可才行啊…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/o1006yiwt7dtvbhlj6hzv37o0idnv0i.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解卡齐娜·其四","desc":"我一直知道，流泪并不能解决任何问题。传说故事里，我从来没听过有英雄会在大家面前哭啊。我很想忍住眼泪，但我总是失败…欸？你说没关系？流泪是一种很重要的发泄方式？你…你真的这么想吗？呜呜呜，谢谢你，呜…我怎么又哭了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/ccdx8r9zcaikzvqwqc5nugw631y2u1l.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解卡齐娜·其五","desc":"我之前一直觉得自己很弱小，被人忽视也是理所当然…但，听到大灵女士那番话之后，我不再那么想了。「乌沙博蒂」是我的古名，我…已经决定要变成更好的「自己」。这个世界上一定有我才能做到的事。我会…继续努力。希望这块黑曜石有朝一日也能容纳我的事迹，成为一颗…更加璀璨的宝石。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/fx4087yy3yawanrgpt35ojeep9gjx4k.mp3"},{"title":"卡齐娜的爱好…","desc":"这块是我第一次挖出来的宝石，翠绿翠绿的，很好看吧？最初它们是一对，另外一块我送给了玛拉妮，你看，它的花纹像流水一样。对了，还有这块，别看它是黑色的，但放在太阳下面就会有五彩斑斓的感觉…嘿嘿，这些全都是我一块一块收集起来的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/spbetqrbh0b6xdvjt216b8sbw1v070m.mp3"},{"title":"卡齐娜的烦恼…","desc":"之前玛拉妮送了我一顶很大的帽子，太酷了，还能完美地遮住太阳，我真的好喜欢，但戴着戴着，它就成了一顶毡帽…后来我只能换成现在这顶不会粘毛的帽子了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/65/gqixu27mcmzzsf72wccan7fj522bjmr.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"粒果片片是我的最爱，要是能堆得整齐一点，那就更加完美了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bc/gjpcjyw2sxm966m3423mkhl5gwmkbmi.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"欸？分量这么大吗？但、但我吃不完的话，不就浪费了厨师的劳动成果吗？唔唔，没关系…我一定可以吃完的！小口小口慢慢吃…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/pf02xqk4suyax4lf5frcou9p8yq46ob.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"哇——真的是送给我的吗？太好吃了！我要慢慢吃，让美味停留得更久一点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/ncoju5wrf38brvoumtvz26ufz551luq.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"又香又好吃，摆盘也很精致。如果有「厨艺战争」的话，你一定会赢吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0d/0iatqvplnrqa1w7xw7zatskcwbvv19d.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"谢谢你愿意为我花时间！我、我一定会吃完的，请再多给我一点时间。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/0uuw4j6o3ybxlinlkvbe6jto0otbwst.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐！这个送给你，是虹闪石雕成的鼠兔。虹闪石的触感温润，但在地下很不起眼，一不留神就会错过…不过带在身边久了，它的光泽就会越来越漂亮的。这是我最喜欢的宝石之一，希望你也喜欢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/f72p95t90z4gpl8jdkdd4b6z1bpjwqt.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"我的耳朵在抖吗？不是紧张…而是开心。对不起，它们现在激动得不得了，我控制不住。我…我捂住它们吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/3g5340uwsdlwwa483jxqn2ohekg4shh.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"你真的非常重视我…呜…呃、我没有想哭的，就是太感动了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/8dib1sq0oe39eebd0057b9mfprl04dz.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"「王庭焚弃，火却未曾殄熄。明晨它要再度燃起，比昨日更为辉熠。」这是陶奥鲁大人说过的话中，我最喜欢的一句。我，我必须要努力才行…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/qhiriflb6xotjhygbztisj96cg3d9pf.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"你带我一起见识了种种新奇的事物，让我成长了很多，我不知道该怎么回报你才好…但这次我想自己找到答案。接下来就让我来当英雄吧，保护你的英雄！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/l85ys8asr4x8asyrg2vjhg6e8os2imi.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"旋转！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/qjd8uz9uyvd0zxxgxn9at9ovwruqbbn.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"嘿——哟！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/tofweb025qvd5cjwyoytog8scdfx3pd.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"来咯！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/8udz24rhs3gckdsxhz7rdd0tw319fyx.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"开转咯！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/chen97f381zr44f6p34ofj2rh1ah9hb.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"冲地波！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/94/iyje7p28ypqr61nxgv1hb27qrhlb5s8.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"冲天转转，出发！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/7yknuzlh5tpo8vqaqk6l5lschg37egg.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"清退！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/exnoq4mvxk0o8vgue2bli47v3aqj88b.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"矿石采集。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/c9xu11es1qjnvhtvlaz384qfhkamkk5.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"切勿靠近。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/ipkcobyzxbtpca0n48vi9l5sr7bdzxx.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"哇哇，有亮晶晶的石头！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/1gkq1wwvi7ge1cgxc31fokti1nq3obb.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"你也喜欢收集石头吗？我懂我懂，这些石头太好看了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3e/2whah7u58urfc4vplkg3pqs48v3snu9.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"需要帮忙整理吗？我很拿手！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/9mxwg22jnxtljc8zi6x44n5h2pko692.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"没事，小伤罢了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/22/so02p2cgkwrszkpjzmthpw4h14idrcq.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"我要…振作起来。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cd/hyrviahcnx36ai4a87d7m7n1t1w59gx.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"我、我一定可以的！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/54/rqdfap5n3qht3n9dj1i3at7dbh12j2t.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"不要忘了还有我呀！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/977ub1wx5wwdwhr0fpukcwgyetbe1o1.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我在！交给我吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/78kt87sj742wexy4c2ruoggmzy4cud6.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"对不起，是我逞强了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/1esmdr6tqakwd7fv0quukidj7btbrx3.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"不能愧对…「乌沙博蒂」…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/gs3s63qbi6t061x2n71igq9awyepwih.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"呜…又搞砸了吗…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/dtn66bw0wb3m8q0wq9l9l7223lfis1h.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"擦伤而已。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/5rk1jh4agbyrwaaiwcmk759jg199hpu.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"唔，不要紧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kachina/vo_kachina_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/be1gv02ru9i1hf0fn0yprefdsv9svks.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"呜哇？我可以参加吗？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kachina_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/fjp7sro1uyu6tf842i7nsz17dckdpim.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"太好了！一起动身吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kachina_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/k7obz7fz14sy3f9vtpx6iq3eol8dr7d.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"又能向你学习战斗技巧了。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kachina_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bb/2eh1dd14k0nd12ik3dctnk1ij8afc1k.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000100-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000100-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1010,"fullArtHeight":897}